AQRmUoCG9TuvYUAMOtTw88brOTwMeYRpXhPdG4SIjv2svw&oe=6B01ED77"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QVAojnR4MlwQ7kNvwH_h-WZ&_nc_oc=AdrkdPZFyjhSbOViLJ9NsyDeb7HJwrjy5UcrRUDtONiHy7vemsrF4pw_o6N1XWmEaf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMIxnh78qZZ-dG9uo58hNQvashXkKOdqU8LKYAJWHXXg&oe=6B01DC87"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RpX74m37Uk0Q7kNvwGEujmR&_nc_oc=AdqqM_HKozHWeo2NDOJt6fwMfUjrDZm1mBSRgsTNtjjH51U7HIOR7LcfwohCdqOLLmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQE3DmGescN6dG0MlcVDZvvpL63NtPZEfcLssYKvDcUrw&oe=6B01C657"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJn4-KnuPLsQ7kNvwH-hUTd&_nc_oc=AdoYl4XQlYdrIg2mVAXTA8zGGZGyfAoR07Eotu_hDNJQfrGsGukClrhkEIRemwZ1z8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQpjLph9ucizhBKsOjkzyXhYYscU9jkmkO0LOyiPIjTLg&oe=6B01BD4F"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IE4bgSoxCo4Q7kNvwGodtLu&_nc_oc=Adq-2oskvrUmzpwkfrglkQ2KYl1wiYjGWgV04tOdz0R1V3xFmDdnO7sWlvHIaN60U-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ0OJpm_2WbYaeUZoouCs3jasdBop7a3eb79WpT6PqXeQ&oe=6B01C6B5"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3QS1qI2aXTQQ7kNvwH4IuiN&_nc_oc=AdrfrHwJSj0ma1CLA6CjUTHPU13EXd-NbBl-bfD94ZyMjxqs3ail7P60g2wCCtt2wZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqJphhUrsGSLhcovrZ6nwLqOyeYgV5obNMZMBpkxRy1g&oe=6B01C005"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca